{"study_accession":"PRJDB20462","secondary_study_accession":"DRP012820","title":"RNA sequencing of human adipose derived stemcells cultured with platelet lysate or FBS","description":"Human adipose-derived stem cells (hASCs) were cultured under three distinct conditions; serum-free medium, medium supplemented with 10% fetal bovine serum (FBS), and medium supplemented with 3% platelet lysate (PL) for a period of 48 hours. Following culture, gene expression profiles were comprehensively analyzed to characterize the transcriptional responses induced by each condition. In particular, to examine the preferential effects of PL, a platelet-derived growth supplement, we compared the transcriptional signatures elicited by PL treatment with those induced by FBS or serum-free culture. This comparative approach aimed to identify unique signaling pathways and gene expression networks that are specifically activated by PL, providing insights into its utility in regenerative medicine.","pubmed":"","geo_series":"","n_samples":8,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMD00896542","study_accession":"PRJDB20462","blood_class":"platelet","class_from":"study","title":"Human adipose derived stem cell cultured with 10% FBS (contrpl1, replicate1)","description":"Keywords: GSC:MIxS;MIGS:6.0","sex":"","geo_sample":"","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2025-05-11","attributes":[["strain","not applicable"],["collection_date","2023-07-12"],["isol_growth_condt","29072818"],["INSDC secondary accession","DRS453273"],["organism","Homo sapiens"],["env_broad_scale","not applicable"],["env_local_scale","not applicable"],["isolate","healthy9yF"],["NCBI submission package","MIGS.eu.human-associated.6.0"],["cultivar","not applicable"],["host","missing"],["geo_loc_name","Japan"],["ecotype","not applicable"],["env_medium","not applicable"],["lat_lon","missing"],["sample_name","control1_FBS_rep1"],["BioSampleModel","MIGS.eu.human-associated"],["ENA-FIRST-PUBLIC","2025-04-18"],["ENA-LAST-UPDATE"